<string name="au22_stremio_notice_title">About add-ons</string>
<string name="au22_stremio_notice_text">This space is an unofficial client for Stremio add-ons. Add-ons are small web services made by independent developers. Telos only shows what an add-on offers and plays it: it includes no add-ons, hosts no videos and does not check what an add-on provides. You are responsible for what you add and watch, and for having the right to watch it where you live. Some add-ons use BitTorrent, which shows your IP address to other users. Telos is not affiliated with Stremio.</string>
